Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(默顿大宅  午夜12:04  2月29日)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(抓鬼特工队)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.63,0:29:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(抓鬼特工队)
