Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.36,0:37:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(月度最佳员工)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.61,0:38:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(缅怀阿伦·J·科贝特  1985年到2008年  不可能之王)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样  我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要拿自己的灵魂换吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're offering up your own soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要复活萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is bring Sam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们给了你多久  - 一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long did they give you? - One year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会想办法救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德·扎德摩和哈里·斯潘格勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed Zeddmore and Harry Spengler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬老巢网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhoundslair.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就该来这里 \N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是超自然调查员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're professional paranormal investigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是想拿到书约  卖电影版权\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just trying to get a book-and-movie deal. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:34.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那玩意给我拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that damn thing out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快走  - 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go. - Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的...  - 指环王啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweet Lord... - Of the Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:41.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想了  我不会再去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. I'm not going back in there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈里  这是我们成功的门票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, this is our ticket to the big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fame,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}money,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:46.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性福\N{\fnArial\fs30}sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟女生性福 \N{\fnArial\fs30}With girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哈里·斯潘格勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Harry Spengler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是艾德·扎德摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am Ed Zeddmore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:00:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你收到了这段影片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you've received this tape,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定是个大电视台高管\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must be some sorta bigwig network executive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天你走运了  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, today is your lucky day, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你即将看到的我们自行拍摄的试播集\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the unsolicited pilot you are about to watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是"真人秀"的勇敢新未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the bold new future of "Reality TV."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.39,0:01:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道你在编剧罢工期间遭到了重创\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you've had it hard during the crippling writers' strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懒胖猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lazy fat cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我们这样的人  还需要编剧做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who needs writers when you got guys like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的团队直面可怕的恐怖  为您带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our team faced horrible horrors to bring you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段将永远改变你世界的影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}the footage that will change your world forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好经历电视史上最恐怖的一小时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So strap in for the scariest hour in the history of television.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这辈子最恐怖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the history of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:38.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备迎接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap in for...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抓鬼特工队  - 抓鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ghostfacers. - Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这其实不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it can get kind of hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平衡我们的日间工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}balancing our daytime careers...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我们的夜间使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}with our nighttime missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  但艾德和我在我们工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But Ed and I pretty much call the shots...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打印店基本上能说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Kinko's where we work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们一般6点就能下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can usually pretty much get off by 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:57.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 每晚都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well. - Every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  6点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. 6:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:03:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前就只有你和我调查案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to be just, you know, you and I taking on the cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就哈里和我  - 两只孤狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just Harry and me. - Two lone wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两只孤狼需要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two lone wolves need...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}other wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早  特工队  - 早  抓鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Facers. - Good morning, Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是晚上7点  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 7 p.m., dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于抓鬼特工队就是早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's morning to a Ghostfacer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特  怎么样了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett, what we got, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:22.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我还在贴...  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just putting up some... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要挂这里  这个挂这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has gotta go up here, that's gotta go here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要全部铺开\N{\fnArial\fs30}gotta see the whole field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克笔  板擦  好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Markers, eraser, good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次见到艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I first saw Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他在斯科根的特价店贴传单时\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting up flyers down at the outlet mall in Scogan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就看了看  然后我就想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I read one and I thought to myself:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"鬼都是哪来的"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where do ghosts come from?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  我就在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  你妹妹在虐待员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, your sister's abusing staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是领养妹妹  谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's adopted sister, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德从我们还小时就一直痴迷于超自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed has been obsessed with the supernatural since we were kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后他跟哈里在\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, and then he meets Harry at...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.19,0:04:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电脑营相识  俩书呆子就一见钟情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}computer camp and love at first geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是斯布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spruce here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}What up, player?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有15/16的犹太血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fifteen-sixteenths Jew...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有1/16的切罗基人血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}one-sixteenth Cherokee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祖父是犹太教割礼执行人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather is a mohel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾祖父是个假山制作人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My great-grandfather was a talus maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾曾祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my great-great-grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个堕落的赌徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a degenerate gambler and,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还对佩奥特掌上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a peyote addiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  各位  别闲聊了  开始准备任务吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, people, let's cut the chatter and get on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.85,0:04:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,默顿大宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morton House.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个大任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our big fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我们都听过传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we all know the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每隔四年  据说这里会成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every four years, supposedly this becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.15,0:04:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全美闹鬼最厉害的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most haunted place in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被称为闰年鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leap-year ghost some call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼魂在午夜归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ghost returns at midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在2月29日的凌晨时分\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as February 29th begins.
