Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一点也不好玩  斯布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so not funny, Spruce!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  好像只是这根树枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it was just... I think it was just this branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就窗上那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真吓人  伙计  - 是很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is spooky, man. - It's pretty spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动  警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Police officers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.99,0:11:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别动  - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move. - God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right. Take it easy. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出示下证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  出示身份证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's see some ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:11:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们被捕了吗  - 我们没带武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we under arrest? - We are unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要解释下这身奇怪的衣服吗  科贝特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to explain that weirdo outfit, Mr., uh, Corbett?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了  拿出身份证件来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure you do. Give me some identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:13.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  我认识你俩  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second. I know the both of you guys. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy ****.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德州  我们消灭的那个幻像怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}West Texas, the tulpa we had to take out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那俩差点害死我们的傻蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two goofballs that almost got us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhounds or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- **** me. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不叫地狱猎犬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not Hellhounds anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 测试效果不好  - 艾德  这怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Didn't test that well. - Ed, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是警察  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not cops, buddy. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  你不是有个搭档吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, Ed, thought you had a partner, too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A different guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 他也在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah. - Is he around here somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在这里捉鬼呢  - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's running around, chasing ghosts. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  你和兰博得带上你的女友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, listen. You and Rambo need to get your girlfriends
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了  大胸男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen here, chisel chest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:53.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经建立了大本营\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already set up base camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们抢先了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们先来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾德  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ed? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的搭档呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10.6\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten-six,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10.7了  各位  电磁场在飙升\N{\fnArial\fs30}ten-seven. Guys, the EMF is really spiking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,温度降低了11度呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temperature's down, like, 11 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  眼睛睁大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right. Keep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬  可以测下这里的读数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, can I get a reading in here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么一直在扰乱芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something keeps messing with the chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 各位  - 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys. Guys. Guys. - What? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计  抱歉  没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, buddy, I'm sorry. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我  那是全部的钱...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, that's all the money I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么来默顿大宅  艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing at the Morton House, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是在闰年  你想什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}On leap year? What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.98,0:13:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是来过夜的  是为了我们的电视节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to spend the night, okay? It's for our TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  好啊  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Great. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  从没有人在这里过过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Nobody's ever spent the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yeah, they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:13:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在这里过夜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause the ones that have,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没能活下来讲述经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}haven't lived to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.29,0:14:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  我才不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  失踪人口报告能追溯到将近50年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, missing-persons reports going back almost a half century.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·格雷姆因赌约留宿  不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Graham stayed on a dare: Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱莉·威尔克森  不见了  还有好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie Wilkerson: Gone. There are tons more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是来过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them came to just stay the night through,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是在闰年\N{\fnArial\fs30}always on a leap year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们唯一发现的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only body they ever found
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.97,0:14:20.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是最后一任屋主  弗里曼·戴格特\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the last owner, Freeman Daggett.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这看上去像真的  - 就是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These look legit. - They are legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:24.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, and we ain't got much time here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:27.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午夜开始  你的朋友会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting at midnight, your friends are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God! My God! My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God! My God! Guys! Guys! My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.65,0:14:33.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我们拍到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, we got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 科贝特  我们看到了  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Corbett! We saw it. - Saw what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们看到幽灵了  - 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We saw it. It was a full apparition! - Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4级幽灵显现\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a Class 4, a spectral illumination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was absolutely amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是德州那些混蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't those the ******** from Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  我们去街对面继续说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's have this reunion across the street, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走吧  - 你们怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on. - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去买冰淇淋吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get you ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们  来  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys, come on, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们该看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  看这个  正经的证据  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Look at this. The honest-to-God proof, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开玩笑吗  - 没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you kidding me? - Yeah. No, not kidding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.31,0:15:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们拍到鬼了  - 读数怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got ghosts. - What kinda reading did we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是10.9  - 10.9吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was a 10.9. - 10.9?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  10.9  快11了都\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was 10.9, it was almost 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出来一看  我想"怎么回事啊"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came out, and I was like, "What's going on?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.73,0:15:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我都...  - 看这部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I was like... - Hold on, watch this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被轰死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got blasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 简直疯了  - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was crazy. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡回声是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a death echo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们有问题  肯定不是那个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if we got a problem here, that ghost ain't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  那是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真发生了  - 死亡回声是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like, that happened. - What's a death echo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回声是被困在循环里的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echoes are trapped in a loop, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不断重复自己死亡的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}They keep replaying how they died over and over and over again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般是在他们被杀的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}usually in the place where they were ganked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险程度相当于恐怖片\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about as dangerous as a scary movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以回声或许并不危险  但还有别的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe the echo's not dangerous, but maybe something else is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  好了  我们得离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. All right. We need to get out of here, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  走  快收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go. Let's go. Let's go, pack it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们  时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们的设备呢  我们怎么办...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about our equipment? What are we gonna...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拍到东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the material.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走吧  - 我们有各种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we go. - We got all kinds of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们可以请你们做常驻客串  - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll make you guys recurring guest stars. - Wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Corbett?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想与这里不安宁的鬼魂交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to communicate with the restless spirits here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灯灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像有夜视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got night-vision here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能丢下任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man left behind.
