Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.15,0:28:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  我才不要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I'm not gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.82,0:28:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向个破真人秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}whine about my ******** problems...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.32,0:28:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱怨我的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}to some ******** reality show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.11,0:28:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要好好工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do my ******* job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.66,0:28:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是癌症吗  - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it cancer? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.75,0:28:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在等有更多朋友来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for some more friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.71,0:28:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.50,0:28:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你会来参加我的派对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're coming to my party, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.84,0:28:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是音乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that music?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.42,0:28:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  是墙后传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's coming from behind this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.35,0:29:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.48,0:29:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会在这里待很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll stay a good, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.57,0:29:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.12,0:29:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.79,0:29:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.10,0:29:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Corbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.69,0:29:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我们做了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, what have we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 科贝特  - 艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Corbett. - Ed. Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.90,0:29:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 科贝特是死亡回声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Corbett's... He's a death echo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.78,0:29:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在重现自己的被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh, reliving his own murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.24,0:30:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and over forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.67,0:30:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个戴格特有什么毛病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this Daggett guy's problem anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.84,0:30:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他没听说过充气娃娃吗  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has he never heard of a RealDoll? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.59,0:30:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴格特是《惊魂记》把老妈做成标本那么孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daggett was the Norman Bates, stuff-your-mother kind of lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.26,0:30:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他才从停尸房偷走了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's why he lifted these bodies from the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:21.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给自己办生日派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He threw himself a birthday party,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只有他们肯来\N{\fnArial\fs30}except they were the only ones who would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.47,0:30:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正  午夜时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, so at midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.60,0:30:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把他们封在了防空洞里  然后上了楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}he sealed them in the bomb shelter and went upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.19,0:30:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服了过多马镇静剂而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and OD'd on horse tranqs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.19,0:30:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.73,0:30:31.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.94,0:30:33.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.15,0:30:35.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  他死了之后  怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so now that he's dead, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换汤不换药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same song, different verse,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.36,0:30:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想继续拉人来他的派对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to get people to come to his party?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.74,0:30:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多吧  永远留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much, yeah. Stay forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.33,0:30:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是真子弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those real bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.58,0:30:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是岩盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostfacers
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去其他人不肯去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go to places where others will not
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.21,0:30:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostfacers
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.13,0:30:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲入险境  不顾危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in the kitchen When the kitchen gets hot
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:30:59.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.51,0:31:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.14,0:31:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.18,0:31:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.65,0:31:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们  那是科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, it's... It's Corbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.98,0:31:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's... He's trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.69,0:31:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很痛苦  我们得...想办法...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in a lot of pain, you know? We gotta... We gotta try and...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.49,0:31:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法帮他脱离循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to try and pull him out of his loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.37,0:31:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.16,0:31:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:29.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.25,0:31:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 别出盐圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. - Don't cross the line of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.75,0:31:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须去  哈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta do it, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.97,0:31:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.47,0:31:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.43,0:31:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.56,0:31:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 退回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My God. - Get back. Get back. Get back. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.06,0:31:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.77,0:31:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他听不到  他总在不断死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not hearing me, okay? He won't stop dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.32,0:32:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.53,0:32:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still shooting?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.87,0:32:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这让他好受点  别问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes him feel better. Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.46,0:32:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们  进入捉鬼状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, guys. Get in your ghost role thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.54,0:32:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.80,0:32:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.81,0:32:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我们要怎么触动他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I know how we can get through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.81,0:32:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.02,0:32:33.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.19,0:32:37.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对你有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.40,0:32:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.49,0:32:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要我做什么  - 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanted me to what? - You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.91,0:32:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.70,0:32:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你得怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what you've gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.25,0:32:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以的  艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.71,0:32:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直是勇敢的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always been the brave one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.71,0:32:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以的  你激励了我们也勇敢起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can. You make us brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.67,0:32:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玛姬  是吧  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.05,0:32:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You totally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得为那个可怜的死掉的实习生基一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta go be gay for that poor, dead intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.10,0:33:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得让他走入光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta send him into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.07,0:33:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.66,0:33:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie. No, no, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.87,0:33:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  没事的  别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's okay. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.29,0:33:33.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.75,0:33:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是艾德  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's just Ed, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.37,0:33:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.92,0:33:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.96,0:33:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  我...我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. I'm... We...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.55,0:33:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.26,0:33:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.14,0:33:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特  你对团队很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett, you meant a lot to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.43,0:33:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.69,0:33:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meant a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.31,0:34:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从不退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, never ever back down...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.99,0:34:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从不发火  好吗  这我都记得  科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}never say a bad word, okay? I remember that, Corbett. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.57,0:34:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都记得  我记得因为我爱你  科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that. I remember because I love you, Corbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.41,0:34:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真心地爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really, truly love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.83,0:34:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.13,0:34:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.50,0:34:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾德  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ed? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.59,0:34:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Corbett, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.34,0:34:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett, yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.06,0:34:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我  看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.60,0:34:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta help us, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.02,0:34:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得帮帮我们  科贝特  求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to help us, Corbett. Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.57,0:34:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你帮帮我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.11,0:34:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张  没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.36,0:34:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.45,0:34:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.62,0:34:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不妙  很不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bad. Very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.21,0:35:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbett?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.10,0:35:14.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.64,0:35:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.50,0:35:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闰年  2月29日  默顿大宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leap year, February 29th, the Morton House.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲惨的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tragic day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.18,0:35:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼魂们在这天饱受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day of souls bound in torment...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:35:58.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命在这天面临威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}of lives held in cruel balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但抓鬼特工队  他们尽了全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Ghostfacers, they did the best that they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.61,0:36:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们失去了一位好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost a beloved friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.48,0:36:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们得到了新盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we gained new allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.82,0:36:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know this much:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.82,0:36:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天  包括今天  都是新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}That every day, including today, is a new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.62,0:36:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在默顿大宅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We learned more than we can
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.33,0:36:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惨痛教训中所学到的是难以言说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}say in the brutal feat of the Morton House.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.38,0:36:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ghostfacers
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.34,0:36:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被迫面对了比鬼更可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}were forced to face something far more scary than ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.68,0:36:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们被迫面对了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were forced to face themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.18,0:36:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争会改变男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}War changes man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.97,0:36:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.85,0:36:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争会改变男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}War changes man...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.56,0:36:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.69,0:36:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科贝特  我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Corbett, we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.28,0:36:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我们想认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}gosh, we just like to think
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.36,0:36:56.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在守护着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're out there watching over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.70,0:37:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们看来  你不是实习生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as we're concerned, you're not an intern anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.41,0:37:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你绝对赢得了做一名抓鬼特工队正式成员的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have more than earned full Ghostfacer status.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.96,0:37:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 而且队里有个鬼也挺酷的  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plus it'd cool to have a ghost on the team. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.88,0:37:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we were thinking that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.38,0:37:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们在教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were teaching you and...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.63,0:37:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实一直以来  是你在教我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}all this time, you were teaching us...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.05,0:37:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教我们爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}about heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.02,0:37:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教我们奉献\N{\fnArial\fs30}about dedication.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.02,0:37:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}About...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.85,0:37:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同性之爱能穿透阴阳之隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}how gay love can pierce through the veil of death and
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.86,0:37:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}save the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.20,0:37:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  阿伦·J·科贝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Alan J. Corbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.45,0:37:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好走入满天星斗的夜空吧  小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go well into that starry night, young Turk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.16,0:37:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.09,0:37:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了  斯布鲁斯  我还得收拾东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Spruce, I gotta get all this stuff packed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.55,0:37:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  边收拾边说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? Pack and talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.68,0:37:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.01,0:37:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想到什么说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say what comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.10,0:38:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的心声时刻  科贝特  吐露心声吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one of our confessional moments, Corbett, so confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得今晚会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you think was gonna happen tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.56,0:38:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得今晚之行会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think's gonna happen tonight on this trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.11,0:38:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.98,0:38:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.36,0:38:14.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们的梦想都将成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think all our dreams are gonna come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.66,0:38:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那听上去很傻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that sound stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.53,0:38:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of does, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.64,0:38:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So guys, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.85,0:38:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.85,0:38:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得还算不错呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I kind of think it was half awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.86,0:38:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还算不错  那就是好了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half awesome. That's full-on good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.65,0:38:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  简直不可思议  你们能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I mean, it's bizarre how y'all are able to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.49,0:38:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,致敬科贝特的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}to honor Corbett's memory
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.24,0:39:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时狠狠地利用了他的死亡  好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}while grossly exploiting the manner of his death. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.62,0:39:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  你的平衡保持得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, it's a real tight rope you guys are walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.70,0:39:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好了  各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.54,0:39:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那是现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's reality, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  科贝特为寻求真相献出生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Corbett gave his life searching for the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.25,0:39:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的工作就是把它展示给世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is our job over here to share it with the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.26,0:39:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  根据我们的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, um, our experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.93,0:39:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道你向世界展示真相时会得到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what you get when you show the world the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.89,0:39:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,束身衣  或面门一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A straitjacket or a punch in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.06,0:39:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有时两个都有  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sometimes both. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.31,0:39:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  两位  别做特工队黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys, don't be Facer haters
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.35,0:39:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为我们刚好拍到了世纪最劲爆影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we happened to have gotten the footage of the century.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.85,0:39:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.11,0:39:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这我们无话可说了  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got us there. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  那回头见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, we'll see you guys around.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.86,0:39:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.78,0:39:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.37,0:39:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.21,0:39:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.75,0:39:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 绝对是  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Totally. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.13,0:39:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开始拷贝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start laying off some DVDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.79,0:39:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听上去是个好主意  斯布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like a good idea, Spruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.38,0:39:59.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们  我觉得我们会需要更大的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, guys, I think we're gonna need a bigger office here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.63,0:40:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们要走向全国\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, because we're gonna go national,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.22,0:40:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再走向全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it's gonna go international, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.76,0:40:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那俩家伙落了舞蹈包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Menudo left their dance bag behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.60,0:40:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.15,0:40:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.73,0:40:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里似乎出了技术故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seem to be having some technical difficulty over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.69,0:40:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等等  - 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait, wait. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.74,0:40:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等等  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! Wait! Wait! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.70,0:40:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"没有操作系统"  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No operating system found"? Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.83,0:40:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没问题了吧  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We clean? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.91,0:40:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开玩笑吗  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you kidding me? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.41,0:40:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.17,0:40:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈里  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Harry. Harry. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.04,0:40:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电磁铁  抹掉他们所有的录像带和硬盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electromagnet. Wiped out every tape and hard drive they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.55,0:40:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界还没准备好迎来抓鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}World just isn't ready for the Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.63,0:40:43.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜  我还挺喜欢这节目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad, I kind of liked the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.22,0:40:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有高光时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had its moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.29,0:41:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳赚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is money in the bank.

